   Drive HQ  - Leading Cloud IT & Cloud Surveillance Services  
    Dear hepsibah,

  You have not logged on to your DriveHQ Cloud account for more than 1 year. Your username is hepsibah (ID: 71880495). NOTE: Free service members must log on once every 3 months otherwise your account and files may be deleted. 

  There are many good reasons to keep your free account active:
 
 - The Easiest Cloud Storage - Cloud Drive Mapping.
 Map cloud storage as a local drive; cloud file Sharing and collaboration with granular access control and file locking. 
 - One-stop Cloud IT Service.
 Being extremely easy is only one advantage. DriveHQ offers very broad Enterprise Cloud features that can migrate your business to the Cloud instantly. 
 - Truly Save Cost.
 Our competitors charge over $15/user/month. In most cases, you can save over 40% with our service. If it is not the case, please let us know and we might offer you a special deal! 
 - A Special Discount of 50%! 
